WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.490
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.090
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.160
The Aikatsu Ranking is held once every four years.{not then the word, but for the less in stuff}

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:21.580
I turned everyone's feelings into radiance on the stage to have a chance against Elza-san's fantastic performance.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.750
And as I did, I even surprised myself by getting the Sun Dress!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:33.880
I was happy to win, but the most important thing was being able to shine with everyone.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.300
And then there was Elza-san.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.130
I'm so happy for you, Elza-san!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.060
Thank you for coming all the way out here.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.770
Yes, Mother.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:48.960
Once I decide on my next course of action, I'll contact you again.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.890
Bye.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:56.670
What comes next...

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:40.300
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.720
It's gonna be another great day for Aikatsu!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:46.850
Yume!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.140
Rola! Good morning.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.140
Morning.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.400
Wait, there's no time for this! Come quick!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.280
I'm coming in...

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.410
Nijino-san, good morning!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.200
Did you sleep well last night?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.120
Has it sunk in yet? How do you feel right now? {domo eto}

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.790
What's going on?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.670
What do you mean, what? 
The press is here to interview you.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.800
Huh?! All of them?

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.260
Of course! Now that you've won the Final Tournament,

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.300
you're the top idol of the whole world!

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.850
The top idol of the world...

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:31.640
And in fact, it's rather unbelievable that the top idol would let herself get photographed in sweats!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.360
Come on, I was just on a run.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.190
Do you jog every day?

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:40.400
Yes! The foundation of Aikatsu is stamina.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.570
What other kind of training do you do?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.320
Let's see, for instance...

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:48.830
Doing air sits elegantly with a smile, the Himetrain.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.580
Staying magnificent while sweating with Elzacise.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.580
So, those would be...

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:59.010
Training methods that my respected Hime-senpai and Elza-san created.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.340
Oh! I've actually been developing my own training regimen recently.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.340
What does that entail?

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.720
I call it the Yumeathlon! {third athlon in this season. somebody's excited about it}

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.470
Yumeathlon?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:13.140
Just like how in a triathlon you swim, bike, and run,

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:18.860
it's a type of super training where you play volleyball, climb cliffs, project your voice, and more!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.360
That sounds like it would be difficult.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.610
That's right! It may be hard, but it's also fun!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.700
Would you like to join me for a round?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.370
It's especially effective if you're out of shape!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.620
Okay! Let's get to it!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:39.880
She's the world's top idol, yet she's acting the same as always.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.760
She's totally unaware of her status.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.340
But that's what gets me going!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.930
Yume-chan can't be any other way.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.640
Feast your eyes on this!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:51.640
These are all applications from prospective students!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:57.940
You've made Four Star Academy's 
reputation skyrocket! Well done, Nijino!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.480
I recall you wanting to expel her at one point.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.990
Th-That was simply tough love.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.240
I'm glad I could be of help.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:10.410
And these are addressed directly to the winner of the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.750
Media from around the world want to interview and host you on their shows.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.880
To think that our Nijino has become the top idol of the world.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.510
That's the rockingest thing ever, baby!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.420
Thanks so much!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:29.600
And finally, this one has your name on it. It's from Elza Forte.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.180
From Elza-san?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.810
A ticket to Venus Ark's last show?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:40.730
I believe she said prior to the Aikatsu Ranking that Venus Ark would be shutting its doors.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.440
She also said she'd retire as an idol...

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.240
But that's exactly what I wanted to prevent.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.700
She probably intended to give up on Aikatsu regardless of the outcome.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:52.950
No... Isn't there any way we can stop her?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.960
That all depends on Elza Forte.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.000
No way...

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.220
Come in.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.690
What's brought all of you here together?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.530
Elza, do you really still plan on shutting down Venus Ark?

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:31.780
Closing down would be baa! Please change your mind!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.780
Please don't do it!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.410
Venus Ark will be terminated as scheduled.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:41.710
As the owner, I have a responsibility to follow through on my words.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.710
Moreover, I was defeated by Yume Nijino.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.510
A loser must descend from the stage with grace.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.300
Elza!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.430
Ladies, prepare to disembark.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.180
Please pardon my interruption.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.690
A visitor is here to see you.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.560
Hi!

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.780
Hime Shiratori?

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:10.450
Three of a kind!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.160
Full house.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.910
Aw, I lost!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.830
But then again, you're really good at all sorts of competitions, Elza-chan.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:24.210
Be defensive when necessary, but ever ready to put everything on the table when the time is right.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.960
That's the secret to victory.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.510
Another round!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.180
Are you giving Aikatsu up?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.350
Yes.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.560
What do you plan to do afterwards?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.020
I'm not sure. I still haven't decided.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:44.150
Then why don't you keep being an idol until you find your next goal?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:49.440
No, Aikatsu is not so forgiving as to allow someone to do it half-heartedly.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.910
I'm sure I'm just preaching to the choir, though.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:54.910
Still...

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.030
Besides...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.160
A ship without a destination is far too dangerous.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.170
One wrong turn, and it may even capsize.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.170
I don't want to burden those girls any further.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:12.380
Why not have a sincere talk with all of the Venus Ark girls about that?

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.010
What was it like to face Yume-chan?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:23.940
I was convinced that the most powerful light in the world was the sun.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:33.570
But then I saw that the radiance of a single star could cause all the stars around it to shine and illuminate the entire sky.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.620
I had no idea it was possible to shine in that way.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:45.250
Me neither! And there are many more unknowns and surprises hidden around the world too.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.670
Isn't that—

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.920
It's my trump card.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.920
I'm looking forward to the look of surprise on Yume-chan's face when she sees it.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.550
Hime Shiratori, you are unbelievable.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:03.520
Nobody can say for sure where Aikatsu or competitions will end up. That's why they're fun.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.060
Don't you think?

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.190
It's strange to feel so refreshed after a loss.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:12.690
The world may contain Aikatsu even beyond what I can imagine.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.820
You might just find it if you continue to search.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:19.410
Doesn't it sound fun to set off on that adventure with your companions?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.580
What are you doing?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.340
It's a sit-in.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:33.550
We will not move from this spot until you abandon the ship's dissolution.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:38.260
No matter what you do, my decision is final.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.020
How long will you keep this up?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:55.440
Elza-sama, we once tried to leave this ship on our own.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.620
But now we want to continue our Aikatsu here no matter what!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:03.990
Your performance at the finals 
touched our hearts. So please—

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.700
It's for your own good.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:13.340
I used every single one of you just to get my hands on the Sun Dress.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:17.220
I exploited your dreams for my own benefit.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.340
Staying with me will do you no good.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.470
If you want to do Aikatsu, look elsewhere.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.770
Elza-san, being here is the most fun I've ever had.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:36.240
I've come to love singing more than before because of everyone here.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:40.740
Everything we have now is all thanks to you!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.580
I lost to Yume Nijino.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.870
I'm not perfect.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.870
Pardon me.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:52.170
Elza-sama, I've brought yesterday's batch of letters.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.000
Shall I dispose of them as usual?

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.210
Wait!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.550
Are these all applications to Venus Ark?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:04.930
Yes, there has been an endless stream throughout and after the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:12.150
Even if it was not perfect, it appears that countless people were moved by your performance.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:19.240
Elza, no matter what you say, our feelings won't change.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:22.570
We'll fight until we've accomplished our goals.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.830
And we learned that from you.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.080
What?

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:32.080
To have ambition, to challenge oneself, to stand strong against any obstacle.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.210
And to know that after you've exhausted your strength, a new dawn will come.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:44.550
Elza, just as your mother was your sun,

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.640
to us, <i>you're</i> our sun!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:52.060
I want to keep on doing Aikatsu with Elza-sama!

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.100
Me too!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.150
Please!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.650
You all...

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.030
Elza!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:01.820
Elza-sama!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:02.700
Elza-san!

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.270
Morning, Elza.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.270
Good morning, Elza-sama.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.270
Good morning, ladies.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.360
Shall we take breakfast together? {I was really close to using "morning" for this, but they just got done saying it three times}{shall we take morning together?}

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.780
Today's morning steak is...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.280
a cut of Elza beef.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.280
Elza beef?

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:53.160
Yes. Elza-sama wished to eat the ultimate steak, 
so she has been developing her own brand of beef.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.460
Today will be my first time trying Elza beef.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.500
I wanted to share this special day with everyone.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.680
Elza, you are truly intriguing.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.800
Let's dig in before it cools.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.180
Thank you for the meal.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.400
Yummy!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.520
It's very delicious!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.820
Quite splendid.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.030
In addition, please bring me a salad.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.370
E-Elza-sama, are you certain?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:36.040
If you only eat the food you like, 
you'll end up nutritionally unbalanced.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:41.880
Just as Aikatsu requires a variety of unique traits, 
a diet needs to be well balanced, don't you think?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.420
Princess Elza...

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.800
Just a moment.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.470
It's a mountain of greens!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.810
Hey, that's way too much!

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.490
What will their last show be like?

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.240
It will be a spectacle.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.240
Let's see them off.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.660
The hall is at full capacity.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.750
I'm so happy!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:23.250
It makes me very happy for all four of us to sing together!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:27.470
Come to think of it, this'll be the first time we go on together.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.890
Let's definitely, definitely make it the best show ever!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:35.560
That goes without saying. Venus Ark is the greatest idol school in the world.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:40.600
Our performance will steal the hearts of all who lay their eyes upon it.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.310
Now, let's go!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:45.320
May the flower of Aikatsu bloom!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:48.820
Come have a sweet dream with Kirara!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:52.320
Everything is for Venus Ark and Elza!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.780
For I am...

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:58.080
No, for we are perfect!{I'm not sure if this necessaries, but I'm not sure if I'm sure either}

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:07.770
Everyone, thank you for your heartfelt cheers.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:12.270
As I said, Venus Ark is closing its doors today.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.530
We have an announcement to make.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:24.240
Up until now, Venus Ark only accepted idols who Elza personally scouted.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.290
However!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:29.540
From now on, anyone who wants to come on board can!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.800
Everyone who wants to become an idol is welcome!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.300
That means...

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.300
Henceforth we are a new idol school—

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.800
Neo Venus Ark!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.310
Nice, I like it!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:50.650
She's continuing her Aikatsu! I'm so relieved.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:54.190
Honestly, she got me all worked up for nothing.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.940
I wonder what the new Venus Ark is going to be like!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:01.070
I'm so excited I can hardly contain myself! {way to change your catchphrase}{thanks yume}

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.540
Ashida Yuri. {NO DON'T GOOOO}{she would have graduated anyway though}

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:14.960
Liszt Juli!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.470
Our unit YuriJuli is now onboard Neo Venus Ark! {in hiragana it's ゆりゆり, whereas Juli is ユーリ. we can do YuriJuli, Yuriyuri, Yuri-Yuri. what do you think?}{I have no strong feelings, but my weak feeling is this}

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.680
Yes!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.850
Even without you, I won't be the slightest bit lone—

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.860
Headbutting is how Carol-tan shows her love.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:36.610
It looks like she really likes you!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.360
Oh, do you now?

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.160
That really hurts!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:46.580
Is she really showing her love?

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:51.290
She must love you so much she doesn't wanna let go.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.540
Honestly...

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.420
I'm glad that all of us grew closer.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.260
So are we.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:06.180
It's because Four Star Academy and Venus Ark encountered one another that we were all able to shine brighter.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.560
Until next time.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:09.390
Let's meet again.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.440
Hime-chan, this is for you.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.310
My, it's a sweet pea. {I actually had this before but didn't think about number}

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.190
Yes!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:22.700
Its floral meaning is "departure". 
Here's to the start of new Aikatsu for all of us. {I took this from other subs}{I like it, but isn't it the kind of thing that you do at the beginning of a thing where you'll use it multiple times? the "flower language" structure is too established. though I guess it's good enough that it can be}{pretty sure nobody will be confused}

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.160
Thank you.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:31.870
Alice Carroll requests the right to board Neo Venus Ark.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.250
Alice...

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.630
I tossed you ashore. Don't you resent me? {or just abandoned}

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:43.300
All that remains in my heart is merci, my feelings of gratitude.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:48.010
I want you to see how much I've learned and grown at Four Star Academy.

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:50.020
Alice...

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.060
Will you accept me?

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.350
Of course. I'm happy to have you!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.940
Elza-sama!

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:57.690
This is lovely!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:58.570
Yume Nijino!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.730
Elza-san!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.280
Don't let your brilliance diminish.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.870
Be strong, and don't lose to anyone.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:11.240
For one day, I'll return to defeat you.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.910
A declaration of war?!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.750
That's Elza-san for you.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.630
That gets me going!

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.750
Of course. Bring it on!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:23.840
Elza-san, let's face off again one day.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:42.780
I'll be baaack for you if you ever think about forgetting Kirara!{there really isn't anything better, huh}{I can always force "baaad" in there}

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:46.780
How could I ever forget about someone like you?!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.780
Bye-bye! Take care!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.040
Until we meet again!

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.800
Farewell, Japan.

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:09.430
Thank you, shining idols.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:14.560
Come, let's set sail!

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.310
Set a course for undiscovered Aikatsu!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:18.940
Yes!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:59.830
Performing with you in matching coords was rather splendid.

